                <div class="layer">
                    <div class="layer-header layer-input">
                        <span>📊 Layer 0: Smart Router</span>
                        <span class="time-badge">&lt; 0.5s</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="layer-content">
                        <div class="component">Automatic path selection based on input</div>
                        <div class="component">• Has axioms only? → Theoretical reasoning</div>
                        <div class="component">• Has data only? → LLM-guided discovery</div>
                        <div class="component">• Has both? → Hybrid approach</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="layer layer-highlight">
                    <div class="layer-header layer-llm-guided">
                        <span>🧠 Layer 1: LLM-Guided Discovery (PRIMARY PATH) ⭐</span>
                        <span class="time-badge">5-10s</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="layer-content">
                        <div class="component success">✅ Phase 1: Data Pattern Analysis (0.5s)</div>
                        <div class="component">  • Tests: linearity, polynomial, power law, exponential</div>
                        <div class="component">  • Computes correlations and complexity</div>
                        <div class="component success">✅ Phase 2: LLM Hypothesis Generation (5s)</div>
                        <div class="component">  • Sends patterns + domain to Claude/GPT</div>
                        <div class="component">  • Gets 5 candidate equations with reasoning</div>
