                        <div class="component success">✅ Phase 3: Rapid Verification + Validation (2-3s)</div>
                        <div class="component">  • Fits coefficients, computes R²</div>
                        <div class="component">  • Runs full validation (dimensional + domain)</div>
                        <div class="component">  • Ranks by combined score: 70% R² + 30% validation</div>
                        <div class="component warning">⚠️ Phase 4: Fallback to PySR if needed (30s)</div>
                        <div class="component">  • Only if R² &lt; 95% OR validation &lt; 70</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="layer">
