                        <span>🔬 Layer 2: Formal Axiom Reasoning (THEORETICAL PATH)</span>
                        <span class="time-badge">2-5s</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="layer-content">
                        <div class="component success">Prove equations from first principles</div>
                        <div class="component">• Axiom-based construction (no data needed)</div>
                        <div class="component">• Example: Derive KE from F=ma, W=∫F·dx</div>
                        <div class="component">• Confidence: 1.0 (mathematically proven)</div>
                        <div class="component">• Used when: only axioms provided, no data</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="layer">
                    <div class="layer-header layer-engine">
                        <span>🧬 Layer 3: Symbolic Regression (FALLBACK PATH)</span>
                        <span class="time-badge">30-180s</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="layer-content">
                        <div class="component">PySR genetic programming</div>
                        <div class="component">• Only used when LLM fails (5-20% cases)</div>
                        <div class="component">• Warm-started from LLM best hypothesis</div>
                        <div class="component">• Full search space exploration</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="layer">
                    <div class="layer-header layer-validation">
                        <span>✅ Layer 4: Complete Validation</span>
                        <span class="time-badge">1-2s</span>
                    </div>
